1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,853
Part (b), four marks, four slots: two devices plus two advantages.

2
00:00:04,853 --> 00:00:08,897
Same scenario: checking product codes in the warehouse.

3
00:00:08,897 --> 00:00:14,706
Device one: barcode or Q R scanner; advantage: fast input, fewer keying errors.

4
00:00:14,706 --> 00:00:19,339
Device two: R F I D reader; advantage: reads many tags at once.

5
00:00:19,339 --> 00:00:24,706
A handheld data terminal also works: check beside the shelf in real time.

6
00:00:24,706 --> 00:00:28,162
A device name without an advantage loses marks.

7
00:00:28,162 --> 00:00:32,280
Do not give output devices such as printers or monitors.

